        "    $column instanceof \\SqlSemantics\\Platform\\MySql\\Ir\\From\\IntegralColumnReference => throw new \\SqlSemantics\\Platform\\MySql\\Model\\Diagnostic\\InvalidConstruction('An extended integral field has no checked set column role.'),",
